name: Study Review membership precedes pagination and retains workspace finding identities
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_review_paging.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: batch batch-test
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 canceled-member | study-review
expect: batch:batch-test
expect: completed-member
expect: superseded-member
expect-not: outside.0
resize: 160x48
live-snap: study-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: study-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: study-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: study-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: study-40x12
nav-mode:
keys: End
live-snap: study-last-40x12
ask: Are all three study findings reachable at all six sizes, with study membership distinct from the global history and completed-pass recurrence?
submit: findings filter limit:2
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 25 Ctrl+N | first-study-page
keys: C-n
require-live-snap: 25 Ctrl+P | last-study-page
keys: C-p
require-live-snap: 25 Ctrl+N | restored-study-page
resize: 120x36
submit: batch clear
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 outside. | workspace-restored
expect-not: batch:batch-test
expect: 2 of 503 matching findings loaded
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 25 Ctrl+N | workspace-paging-controls
submit: findings filter clear
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 25 Ctrl+N | global-first-page
keys: C-n
require-live-snap: 25 canceled-member | global-tail
expect: completed-member
expect: superseded-member
expect: Ctrl+P
ask: Does clearing the study restore the workspace list while retaining ordinary filters, with the same finding aliases on the final global page?
submit: batch batch-test
submit: findings filter severity:info limit:3
require-live-snap: 25 canceled-member | study-before-metadata-error
nav-mode:
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 F-0503 · FINDING | selected-before-metadata-error
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_review_paging.py @TMP_TARGET @ART hide-plan
submit: findings refresh
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · study unavailable | unreadable-study
expect: batch:batch-test
expect: severity:info limit:3
expect-not: outside.
expect-not: canceled-member
expect-not: 0 matches
expect-not: previous results
keys: Escape
resize: 160x48
live-snap: unavailable-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: unavailable-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: unavailable-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: unavailable-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 batch clear | unavailable-40x12
expect: findings refresh
expect-not: 0 matches
ask: Does an unavailable study retain its scope and show both retry and explicit workspace-history controls at every size without claiming zero findings?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_review_paging.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore-plan
submit: findings refresh
require-live-snap: 25 canceled-member | study-restored-after-error
expect: severity:info limit:3
expect: F-0503 · FINDING
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_review_paging.py @TMP_TARGET @ART read
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: batch batch-test
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 canceled-member | recovered-study
expect: batch:batch-test
expect: completed-member
expect: superseded-member
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_review_paging.py @TMP_TARGET @ART hide-plan
submit: findings refresh
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · study unavailable | no-color-study-unavailable
expect: findings refresh
expect: batch clear
expect-not: 0 matches
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_review_paging.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore-plan
submit: findings refresh
require-live-snap: 25 canceled-member | no-color-study-restored
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_review_paging.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve all raw observations and study membership without new jobs, decisions, requests or inferred fixes?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
